                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How long does it take to scale from ₹10 lakh to ₹10 Cr?</h3>
                                        <p>18-36 months for well-executing brands. Faster is possible but usually breaks unit economics.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the single biggest scale-up mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Skipping stages. Especially: launching internationally or adding marketplaces before proving the engine in Stage 1-2.</p>
                                        <h3>Do I need VC funding to hit ₹10 Cr ARR?</h3>
                                        <p>No — many D2C brands hit ₹10-30 Cr ARR bootstrapped. Requires discipline on unit economics.</p>
                                        <h3>When should I hire a CMO?</h3>
                                        <p>Usually at ₹3-6 Cr ARR when the marketing function crosses 4-6 people and needs strategic ownership.</p>
